#, fuzzy
msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Estimated Marginal Means"
msgstr "边际均值估计"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid ""
"Options to compute estimated marginal means, allowing examination of "
"predicted values at specific levels of moderators and their differences from "
"0."
msgstr "用于计算估计边际均值的选项，允许检验调节变量特定水平处的预测值及其与0的差异。"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Effect size"
msgstr "效应量"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid ""
"Variables selected for computing estimated marginal means in the effect size "
"model."
msgstr "为在效应量模型中计算估计边际均值而选择的变量。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Add adjusted estimate"
msgstr "添加调整后估计"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid ""
"Include the adjusted effect estimate, which accounts for the moderators in "
"the meta-regression model. This provides the effect size adjusted for the "
"influence of moderators, as opposed to the pooled effect which combines the "
"estimates across all studies."
msgstr "纳入考虑元回归模型中调节变量的调整后效应估计。这提供了针对调节变量影响进行调整的效应量，与合并各项研究估计的合并效应相对应。"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid "Test against 0"
msgstr "与0比较"

msgctxt "RobustBayesianMetaAnalysisEstimatedMarginalMeans|"
msgid ""
"Option to test the estimated marginal means against 0. The test for the "
"adjusted estimate is available only for meta-regression models with centred "
"parameterization (i.e., no treatment factor contrasts). The test for the "
"estimated marginal means is performed using a Savage-Dickey Density Ratio "
"test based on the prior and posterior distributions assuming either the "
"presence of the effect or moderation."
msgstr "对估计边际均值与0进行检验的选项。调整后估计的检验仅适用于采用居中参数化（即无处理因素对比）的元回归模型。估计边际均值的检验使用基于先验和后验分布（假设存在效应或调节）的Savage-Dickey密度比检验执行。"

