msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Construct"
msgstr "结构"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable identifying the construct, outcome, or endpoint measured by each "
"effect size. Required for compound symmetry times autoregressive structures."
msgstr "标识每个效应量所测量的结构、结局或终点的变量。用于复合对称乘以自回归结构。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Within cluster correlation"
msgstr "聚类内相关"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Assumed correlation between sampling errors within clusters (compound "
"symmetry)."
msgstr "聚类内抽样误差之间的假设相关（复合对称）。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Time"
msgstr "时间"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying the time point of each effect size, required for "
"autoregressive (CAR) structures."
msgstr "指定每个效应量时间点的变量，用于自回归（CAR）结构。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Lag 1 correlation"
msgstr "滞后1相关"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Correlation for lag-1 time points in autoregressive structures."
msgstr "自回归结构中滞后1时间点的相关。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Effect size variance-covariance matrix file"
msgstr "效应量方差-协方差矩阵文件"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"CSV file containing the precomputed effect size variance-covariance matrix. "
"The matrix needs to match the dimensions of the data set and cannot contain "
"any other variables or names."
msgstr "包含预先计算的效应量方差-协方差矩阵的CSV文件。矩阵必须与数据集的维度匹配，且不能包含任何其他变量或名称。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Correlation Matrix"
msgstr "相关矩阵"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying the correlation between the individual estimates within "
"cluster. The column order of the variable correspond to the row order of "
"effect size estimates within cluster. Only the lower triangle needs to be "
"specified. Corresponds to the `rvars` option in the metafor's 'vcalc' "
"function."
msgstr "指定聚类内各估计之间相关的变量。变量的列顺序对应于聚类内效应量估计的行顺序。只需指定下三角。对应于metafor的'vcalc'函数中的`rvars`选项。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying the construct measured by the effect size. Corresponds "
"to the `obs` option in the metafor's 'vcalc' function."
msgstr "指定由效应量测量的结构的变量。对应于metafor的'vcalc'函数中的`obs`选项。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Construct Type"
msgstr "结构类型"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying the type of construct measured by the effect size. "
"Construct Type corresponds to a higher level grouping of the Constructs. "
"Corresponds to the `type` option in the metafor's 'vcalc' function."
msgstr "指定由效应量测量的结构类型的变量。结构类型对应于结构更高级别的分组。对应于metafor的'vcalc'函数中的`type`选项。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Time 1"
msgstr "时间1"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying the time point of the effect size measurement. In case "
"multiple time points are specified, the first time corresponds to the first "
"condition."
msgstr "指定效应量测量时间点的变量。如果指定多个时间点，第一个时间对应于第一个条件。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Time 2"
msgstr "时间2"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying the time point of the effect size measurement. In case "
"multiple time points are specified, the second time corresponds to the "
"second condition."
msgstr "指定效应量测量时间点的变量。如果指定多个时间点，第二个时间对应于第二个条件。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Group 1"
msgstr "组1"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable to specify the group of the first condition when the observed "
"effect sizes or outcomes represent contrasts between two conditions. "
"Corresponds to the `grp1` argument in the metafor's 'vcalc' function."
msgstr "当观察到的效应量或结局表示两个条件之间的对比时，用于指定第一个条件组的变量。对应于metafor的'vcalc'函数中的`grp1`参数。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Group 2"
msgstr "组2"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable to specify the group of the second condition when the observed "
"effect sizes or outcomes represent contrasts between two conditions. "
"Corresponds to the `grp1` argument in the metafor's 'vcalc' function."
msgstr "当观察到的效应量或结局表示两个条件之间的对比时，用于指定第二个条件组的变量。对应于metafor的'vcalc'函数中的`grp1`参数。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Group Size 1"
msgstr "组大小1"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable to specify the size of the group (or more generally, the inverse-"
"sampling variance weight) of the first condition when the observed effect "
"sizes or outcomes represent contrasts between two conditions. Corresponds to "
"the `w1` argument in the metafor's 'vcalc' function."
msgstr "当观察到的效应量或结局表示两个条件之间的对比时，用于指定第一个条件组大小（或更一般地，逆抽样方差权重）的变量。对应于metafor的'vcalc'函数中的`w1`参数。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Group Size 2"
msgstr "组大小2"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Optional numeric vector to specify the size of the group (or more generally, "
"the inverse-sampling variance weight) of the second condition when the "
"observed effect sizes or outcomes represent contrasts between two "
"conditions. Corresponds to the `w2` argument in the metafor's 'vcalc' "
"function."
msgstr "当观察到的效应量或结局表示两个条件之间的对比时，用于指定第二个条件组大小（或更一般地，逆抽样方差权重）的可选数值向量。对应于metafor的'vcalc'函数中的`w2`参数。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Subcluster"
msgstr "子聚类"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying additional structure of the subgroups. Effect sizes "
"within the same cluster with different values of the cluster variable are "
"assumed to be independent. Note that this input corresponds to the "
"'subgroup' option in the metafor's 'vcalc' function and is renamed for "
"differentiation from subgroup analysis. "
msgstr "指定亚组额外结构的变量。同一聚类内聚类变量值不同的效应量被假定为独立。请注意，此输入对应于metafor的'vcalc'函数中的'subgroup'选项，为与亚组分析区分而重命名。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Cluster"
msgstr "聚类"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Variable specifying clustering of the effect sizes for computing the "
"variance covariance matrix. Effect sizes with different values of the "
"cluster variable are assumed to be independent. Note that this input differs "
"from the 'Clustering' option in the data input which is used to specify "
"cluster-robust standard error. In most cases however, both input should "
"contain the same variable."
msgstr "指定用于计算方差协方差矩阵的效应量聚类的变量。聚类变量值不同的效应量被假定为独立。请注意，此输入不同于数据输入中用于指定聚类稳健标准误的“聚类”选项。不过在大多数情况下，两个输入应包含相同的变量。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Construct Correlation Matrix"
msgstr "结构相关矩阵"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Common correlation"
msgstr "公共相关"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Specify the correlation between the same construct levels."
msgstr "指定相同结构水平之间的相关。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"CSV file containing the correlation matrix between the constructs levels. "
"The first row and the first column of the file must contain names that map "
"the matrix entries to the construct level names (the names cannot start with "
"a number)."
msgstr "包含结构水平之间相关矩阵的CSV文件。文件的第一行和第一列必须包含将矩阵条目映射到结构水平名称的名称（名称不能以数字开头）。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Construct Type Correlation Matrix"
msgstr "结构类型相关矩阵"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"CSV file containing the correlation matrix between the constructs type "
"level. The first row and the first column of the file must contain names "
"that map the matrix entries to the construct level type names (the names "
"cannot start with a number)."
msgstr "包含结构类型水平之间相关矩阵的CSV文件。文件的第一行和第一列必须包含将矩阵条目映射到结构水平类型名称的名称（名称不能以数字开头）。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Time lag 1 correlation"
msgstr "时间滞后1相关"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Check positive definiteness"
msgstr "检查正定性"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Check if the variance-covariance matrix is symmetric."
msgstr "检查方差-协方差矩阵是否对称。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Force positive definiteness"
msgstr "强制正定性"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid ""
"Force the variance-covariance matrix to be positive definite. This option "
"shuld be used with caution as non-positive definite matricies often indicate "
"input misspecification."
msgstr "强制方差-协方差矩阵为正定的。此选项应谨慎使用，因为非正定矩阵通常表明输入设定错误。"

msgctxt "ClassicalMetaAnalysisMultivariate|"
msgid "Save computed variance-covariance matrix"
msgstr "保存计算出的方差-协方差矩阵"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Selected Variables"
msgstr "选定变量"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid ""
"Select variables containing estimate-level information to be printed in the "
"left section of the panel for estimate rows."
msgstr "选择包含要在面板左部分为估计行打印的估计水平信息的变量。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Title"
msgstr "标题"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Width"
msgstr "宽度"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Alignment"
msgstr "对齐"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid ""
"Adjust the Title, Width, and Alignment of each column in the left section "
"for estimate rows."
msgstr "为估计行调整左部分每列的标题、宽度和对齐。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Middle"
msgstr "中"

msgctxt "ForestPlotEstimateInformation|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Forest Plot"
msgstr "森林图"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Options for visualizing study-level information, estimated marginal means, "
"and the model information in an all encompassing forest plot. Different "
"sections of the forest plot can be individually enabled/disabled."
msgstr "用于在全面性的森林图中可视化研究水平信息、估计边际均值和模型信息的选项。森林图的不同部分可以单独启用/禁用。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Study information"
msgstr "研究信息"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Add study-level information panel to the forest plot. There are three "
"sections of the study-level information panel: a) the left section with "
"study labels, names, and etc designed via the 'Selected Variables' option, "
"b) the middle section visualizing the estimates and confidence intervals "
"based on the meta-analytic input, c) the right section textually summarizing "
"the estimates and confidence intervals based on the meta-analytic input."
msgstr "向森林图添加研究水平信息面板。研究水平信息面板有三个部分：a) 通过“选定变量”选项设计的左部分，包含研究标签、名称等；b) 基于元分析输入可视化估计和置信区间的中部分；c) 以文本形式汇总基于元分析输入的估计和置信区间的右部分。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Estimated marginal means"
msgstr "估计边际均值"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Add estimated marginal means information to the forest plot. Available when "
"effect size meta-regression is specified."
msgstr "向森林图添加估计边际均值信息。当指定效应量元回归时可用。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Model Variables"
msgstr "模型变量"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Selected Variables"
msgstr "选定变量"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Select variables for which the estimated marginal means are visualized."
msgstr "选择要为其可视化估计边际均值的变量。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Term tests"
msgstr "项检验"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the omnibus term test of variables included in the estimated "
"marginal means. The null hypothesis states that the effect size at all "
"levels of the categorical variable are equal or that there is no linear "
"association between the effect size and the continuous variable."
msgstr "包含估计边际均值中所含变量的全能项检验。零假设表明分类变量所有水平上的效应量相等，或效应量与连续变量之间不存在线性关联。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Coefficient tests"
msgstr "系数检验"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include coefficient tests of variables included in the estimated marginal "
"means. The null hypothesis states that the estimated marginal mean for a "
"given level equals the tested value."
msgstr "包含估计边际均值中所含变量的系数检验。零假设表明给定水平的估计边际均值等于检验值。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Against"
msgstr "对比"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Specify the test value for the coefficient tests."
msgstr "指定系数检验的检验值。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Coefficient tests against 0"
msgstr "与0比较的系数检验"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include coefficient tests of variables included in the estimated marginal "
"means against 0. The null hypothesis states that the estimated marginal mean "
"for a given level equals the tested value."
msgstr "包含估计边际均值中所含变量与0比较的系数检验。零假设表明给定水平的估计边际均值等于检验值。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Adjusted effect size estimate"
msgstr "调整后效应量估计"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the adjusted effect size estimate in the estimated marginal means "
"section."
msgstr "在估计边际均值部分包含调整后效应量估计。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Model information"
msgstr "模型信息"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Add meta-analytic model information to the forest plot."
msgstr "向森林图添加元分析模型信息。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Heterogeneity"
msgstr "异质性"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Test"
msgstr "检验"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the test of the residual heterogeneity in the model information "
"section."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含残差异质性检验。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Wald test"
msgstr "Wald检验"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the Wald-type test of the residual heterogeneity in the model "
"information section."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含残差异质性的Wald型检验。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Likelihood ratio test"
msgstr "似然比检验"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the likelihood ratio test of the residual heterogeneity in the model "
"information section."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含残差异质性的似然比检验。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Estimate"
msgstr "估计值"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "𝜏"
msgstr "𝜏"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the meta-analytic 𝜏, the square root of the estimated between-study "
"variance in the model information section. Not available for multilevel/"
"multivariate meta-analysis."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含元分析𝜏，即估计研究间方差的平方根。多层次/多元元分析不提供。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "𝜏²"
msgstr "𝜏²"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the meta-analytic 𝜏², the estimated between-study variance in the "
"model information section. Not available for multilevel/multivariate meta-"
"analysis."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含元分析𝜏²，即估计的研究间方差。多层次/多元元分析不提供。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "I²"
msgstr "I²"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "H²"
msgstr "H²"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Moderation test"
msgstr "调节检验"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the omnibus heterogeneity moderation test in the model information "
"section. Available when heterogeneity meta-regression is specified."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含全能异质性调节检验。当指定异质性元回归时可用。"

#, fuzzy
msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Effect Size"
msgstr "效应量"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Fixed effect estimate"
msgstr "固定效应估计"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include a fixed effect meta-analytic effect size estimate in the model "
"information section. Not available if the model was already fitted with "
"fixed effects or the model contains heterogeneity meta-regression."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含固定效应元分析效应量估计。如果模型已用固定效应拟合或模型包含异质性元回归，则不提供。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Fixed effect estimate test"
msgstr "固定效应估计检验"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the test of the fixed effect meta-analytic effect size estimate in "
"the model information section."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含固定效应元分析效应量估计的检验。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Pooled estimate"
msgstr "合并估计"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the overall meta-analytic effect size estimate in the model "
"information section."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含总体元分析效应量估计。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Pooled estimate test"
msgstr "合并估计检验"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the test of the overall meta-analytic effect size estimate in the "
"model information section."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含总体元分析效应量估计的检验。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the test of the overall meta-analytic effect size estimate in the "
"model information section. If a meta-regression model is fitted, the test "
"corresponds to either the adjusted effect or the meta-regression intercept "
"term and the corresponding estimate is also displayed. The test is available "
"only if Bayesian model averaging for the effect is selected."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含总体元分析效应量估计的检验。如果拟合了元回归模型，则检验对应于调整后效应或元回归截距项，并同时显示相应的估计。仅当为效应选择了贝叶斯模型平均时，此检验才可用。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the omnibus effect size moderation test in the model information "
"section. Available when effect size meta-regression is specified."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含全能效应量调节检验。当指定效应量元回归时可用。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Publication Bias"
msgstr "发表偏倚"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Include the publication bias test in the model information section."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含发表偏倚检验。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Prediction intervals"
msgstr "预测区间"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Include prediction intervals of the estimated marginal means and the model "
"information output."
msgstr "包含估计边际均值和模型信息输出的预测区间。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Estimates and confidence intervals"
msgstr "估计与置信区间"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Include effect size estimates and confidence intervals summary text in the "
"right panel."
msgstr "在右面板中包含效应量估计和置信区间汇总文本。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Conditional estimates"
msgstr "条件估计"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Display the conditional effect, heterogeneity, and estimated marginal means "
"estimates."
msgstr "显示条件效应、异质性和估计边际均值估计。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Tests in right panel"
msgstr "右侧面板中的检验"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Move test results text to the right panel."
msgstr "将检验结果文本移到右面板。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Align left panel"
msgstr "对齐左侧面板"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Middle"
msgstr "中"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Subgroup"
msgstr "亚组"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Specify the forest plot behavior for subgroup analysis."
msgstr "指定亚组分析时森林图的显示行为。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Show subgroup titles"
msgstr "显示亚组标题"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Show the subgroup heading labels in the forest plot."
msgstr "在森林图中显示亚组标题标签。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Panels within subgroup"
msgstr "亚组内的面板"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Group the output panels within their subgroup membership."
msgstr "将输出面板按其亚组隶属关系分组。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Full dataset estimated marginal means"
msgstr "完整数据集估计边际均值"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Include the full dataset estimated marginal means in the forest plot if "
"subgroups are specified."
msgstr "如果指定了亚组，在森林图中包含完整数据集估计边际均值。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Full dataset model information"
msgstr "完整数据集模型信息"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid ""
"Include the full dataset model information in the forest plot if subgroups "
"are specified."
msgstr "如果指定了亚组，在森林图中包含完整数据集模型信息。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSettings|"
msgid "Auxiliary"
