msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the meta-analytic I², the percentage of total variation across "
"studies due to heterogeneity in the model information section. Not available "
"for multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis or heterogeneity meta-regression."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含元分析I²，即研究间总变异中由异质性引起的百分比。多层次/多元元分析或异质性元回归不提供。"

msgctxt "ForestPlotSection|"
msgid ""
"Include the meta-analytic H², an index indicating the ratio of total "
"variability to sampling variability in the model information section. Not "
"available for multilevel/multivariate meta-analysis or heterogeneity meta-"
"regression."
msgstr "在模型信息部分包含元分析H²，即指示总变异性与抽样变异性之比的指数。多层次/多元元分析或异质性元回归不提供。"
